  "notes": "{当|あ}たる is a highly polysemous intransitive verb. The core idea is \"something comes into contact or alignment.\"\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{当|あ}てる→当てる：01864_ateru⟧ (transitive — to hit something, to guess correctly)\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. TO HIT: ⟦ボール→ボール：00017_booru⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}たる (ball hits the head)\n2. TO WIN: ⟦くじ→くじ：10315_kuji⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}たる (to win a lottery)\n3. TO BE CORRECT: ⟦{予想|よそう}→予想：03664_yosou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{当|あ}たる (prediction comes true)\n4. TO APPLY TO: 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}たる (to correspond to, to fall under)\n5. TO BE EXPOSED: ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}たる (to be exposed to sunlight)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{当|あ}たり→当たり：01919_atari⟧: a hit, success (noun)\n- ⟦{当|あ}たり{前|まえ}→当たり前：01685_atarimae⟧: natural, obvious\n- ⟦{当|あ}たり{外|はず}れ→当たり外れ：12551_atarihazure⟧: hit or miss",
